{"3048750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fool's Court", "steam_appid": 3048750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fool’s Court</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the king. Petitioners crowd your throne with tales of theft, betrayal, and ambition. You listen. You rule. And your decisions tip the kingdom’s fragile balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule From the Throne</strong><br>Petitions never stop! each one a knot of lies, half-truths, and desperate pleas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear raw stories from farmers, nobles, merchants, and old rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue your decree, punish, pardon, investigate, or exile. and see stability shift.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Rulings Shape Stability</strong><br>One decision starts a chain. Your kingdom tracks it all.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh rulings boost order but breed resentment among the powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leniency calms the masses but emboldens lawbreakers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stability low? Expect riots, trade stalls, desperate pleas. High? Prosperity, complex cases, loyal subjects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stability Is Your Reign</strong><br>Petitions unlock new conflicts based on your choices.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neglect the nobles? Watch faction schemes unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore the commons? Hear their anger grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance both? Navigate the intricate web of favors, debts, and fragile alliances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The throne awaits.</strong><br>Will you rule with iron, mercy, or cunning? Stability hangs by your next decree.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fool’s Court</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the king. Petitioners crowd your throne with tales of theft, betrayal, and ambition. You listen. You rule. And your decisions tip the kingdom’s fragile balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule From the Throne</strong><br>Petitions never stop! each one a knot of lies, half-truths, and desperate pleas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear raw stories from farmers, nobles, merchants, and old rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue your decree, punish, pardon, investigate, or exile. and see stability shift.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Rulings Shape Stability</strong><br>One decision starts a chain. Your kingdom tracks it all.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh rulings boost order but breed resentment among the powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leniency calms the masses but emboldens lawbreakers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stability low? Expect riots, trade stalls, desperate pleas. High? Prosperity, complex cases, loyal subjects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stability Is Your Reign</strong><br>Petitions unlock new conflicts based on your choices.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neglect the nobles? Watch faction schemes unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore the commons? Hear their anger grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance both? Navigate the intricate web of favors, debts, and fragile alliances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The throne awaits.</strong><br>Will you rule with iron, mercy, or cunning? Stability hangs by your next decree.</p>", "short_description": "You are the king. 